Initial commit: TeamFlow Voice Agent Service

- Voice agent service (TypeScript/Express): Asterisk AMI, Whisper STT, Piper TTS
- LLM clients: MiniMax, Ollama, OpenAI
- Agent flow executor: 7 step types (speak, collect, condition, transfer, task_update, delay, end)
- Campaign runner for outbound call campaigns
- REST API: /agents, /campaigns, /calls, /stats/summary
- PostgreSQL schema in 'voice' namespace
- Socket.IO real-time events
- Docker + Asterisk SIP/IVR configs
- Frontend: VoiceAgents, Campaigns, CallLogs pages with full UI
